1
00:00:00,292 --> 00:00:01,672
(Leonard:)Hang on.

2
00:00:02,211 --> 00:00:05,631
They're showing a digital Time Bandits.
You wouldn't wanna come, would you?

3
00:00:05,798 --> 00:00:07,258
(Penny:)Not really, no.

4
00:00:07,424 --> 00:00:10,134
(Sheldon:)All right. Invitation pointlessly offered,
declined as expected.

5
00:00:10,302 --> 00:00:13,472
(Sheldon:)Everyone's civil, nobody's fighting.
Have a nice evening.

6
00:00:15,641 --> 00:00:17,221
Just give us a minute?

7
00:00:17,393 --> 00:00:19,433
(Howard:)Take all the time you need.

8
00:00:23,273 --> 00:00:25,863
So are we gonna talk about last night?

9
00:00:26,026 --> 00:00:28,816
(Penny:)-Are you ready to apologize?
-No.

10
00:00:28,987 --> 00:00:31,827
Ehh! Wrong answer.
But thank you for playing.

11
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:33,740
(Leonard:)Come on. This is stupid.

12
00:00:33,909 --> 00:00:36,159
(Penny:)Oh, there it is again.
You think I'm stupid.

13
00:00:36,328 --> 00:00:39,038
(Leonard:)No. There's a difference
between being and acting stupid.

14
00:00:39,206 --> 00:00:43,206
(Penny:)Oh, yeah? Well, there's a difference
between being a jerk and being an ass.

15
00:00:43,377 --> 00:00:46,667
No, there isn't. They're synonyms.

16
00:00:48,549 --> 00:00:50,759
(Raj:)Well, that was rather unpleasant.

17
00:00:51,093 --> 00:00:54,973
(Howard:)Yeah. I don't think I need
my pre-show urination anymore.

18
00:00:56,473 --> 00:00:58,513
(Sheldon:)Leonard, when that woman moved in
three years ago...

19
00:00:58,684 --> 00:01:06,024
(Sheldon:)...I told you not to talk to her.
Now look, we are late for the movies.

